     "t": "heading",
     "level": "h3",
     "html": "Here's what our customers are saying about us:",
     "text": "Here's what our customers are saying about us:"
    },
    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<ul><li>\n<a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVwebKv4W7ZYlZPsEyoo4IkqM5FZsLLnBw95-wu3WqGHc-CZul5=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n<img data-ref=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVwebKv4W7ZYlZPsEyoo4IkqM5FZsLLnBw95-wu3WqGHc-CZul5=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" alt=\"Rusty pigeons\">\n</a><p>Rusty Pigeons</p><p>10/11/2026 10:05 PM</p><p>5.0</p><p>James rules !</p></li><li>\n<a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJb-nTSPgXS1ZvJLfBXZNpq70VWM6CTLIdgBTGI-hxuLE4tPQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n<img data-ref=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJb-nTSPgXS1ZvJLfBXZNpq70VWM6CTLIdgBTGI-hxuLE4tPQ=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100\" alt=\"Gloria ronga\">\n</a><p>Gloria Ronga</p><p>10/10/2026 01:54 AM</p><p>5.0</p><p>Clean store well stocked and Natalia was great answering all my questions that I had! 35% off first time buyer! What’s not to love! Will definitely go back again and again!</p></li><li>\n<a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJGiFCyVvwGUbvUpKtaSgF_Fo2zlTKzgSTXTPvMqxWbYe5rQQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n<img data-ref=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJGiFCyVvwGUbvUpKtaSgF_Fo2zlTKzgSTXTPvMqxWbYe5rQQ=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" alt=\"Penny blake\">\n</a><p>Penny Blake</p><p>10/05/2026 08:30 PM</p><p>5.0</p><p>I went here a few weeks ago and had the most lovely experience. Cathy was super helpful and kind, and had the best recommendations! 10/10 my absolute favorite dispensary I've ever gone to and will definitely be back. Thank you Cathy - you are truly the best!</p></li><li>\n<a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdsuC4jtPh2EStt00qOSdzybhM9n6rSkmc6prnApYhn7RRgDSf=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n<img data-ref=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWdsuC4jtPh2EStt00qOSdzybhM9n6rSkmc6prnApYhn7RRgDSf=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" alt=\"Dennis perry\">\n</a><p>Dennis Perry</p><p>10/04/2026 03:43 PM</p><p>5.0</p><p>Hwy 90 an OG of Marlton is the spot! Low key 🔥. Fast service. Always very helpful and friendly, Diamond is usually my girl and knows what I like.</p></li><li>\n<a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXivbD3KeltyDohBqPMFOEhmpTRNrC3syCbufs-bVTQHC_tdIMf=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n<img data-ref=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXivbD3KeltyDohBqPMFOEhmpTRNrC3syCbufs-bVTQHC_tdIMf=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" alt=\"Paul tiver\">\n</a><p>Paul Tiver</p><p>09/30/2026 11:45 PM</p><p>5.0</p><p>Dude who goes by donut is awesome, funny as too, 10/10 service. Will continue buying here 💯💯</p></li><li>\n<a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLdyiOYNhW__aQrKeovn8opc630NGvMh7uV7YVyJtCoBsjNtg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n<img data-ref=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLdyiOYNhW__aQrKeovn8opc630NGvMh7uV7YVyJtCoBsjNtg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" alt=\"Green afrodite\">\n</a><p>Green Afrodite</p><p>09/23/2026 12:47 PM</p><p>5.0</p><p>Highway to good deals, good vibes and amazing budtenders like Marianne, Emma, Diamond and can’t leave out the guys like Park and Jordan! Place feels like a local spot to catch up with neighbors and friends as I witness folks who work together or know each other catch up and hang for a second at times. Less pretentious and more cozy here and I love the one on one shopping. Keep up the great work!</p></li><li>\n<a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXefNBjPnE07PaXeOcOG70deWiJidUcVbyXzCVAxekHzdQzw9dvlg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n<img data-ref=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXefNBjPnE07PaXeOcOG70deWiJidUcVbyXzCVAxekHzdQzw9dvlg=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" alt=\"Nikki sharp\">\n</a><p>Nikki Sharp</p><p>09/21/2026 06:41 PM</p><p>5.0</p></li><li>\n<a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW80VyX4yLXdGeZNxKFW0P7hgqChjf-JCLFrHDEDpeTUT_RQUzi=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n<img data-ref=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW80VyX4yLXdGeZNxKFW0P7hgqChjf-JCLFrHDEDpeTUT_RQUzi=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100\" alt=\"Ana serales\">\n</a><p>Ana Serales</p><p>09/19/2026 10:57 PM</p><p>5.0</p><p>Great place, deals, and friendly staff!</p></li><li>\n<a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVD5fOM48f5QV0vVo68vd3yGaEpsKEnoWBL9G-6A5TDr6rVfpz8=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n<img data-ref=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVD5fOM48f5QV0vVo68vd3yGaEpsKEnoWBL9G-6A5TDr6rVfpz8=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" alt=\"Dante a\">\n</a><p>Dante A</p><p>09/19/2026 03:35 PM</p><p>5.0</p><p>Beyond lovely, welcoming staff that goes above and beyond for its patrons. Their disposition of offering consecutive first time discounts is a testament to their loyalty to the people. Catherine, was an absolute angel, and a great representative of Highway 90. She listened to my preferences and gave several options tailored suit. Very amazing experience ❤️‍🔥</p></li><li>\n<a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWk81HTJzmWT-PX4oXQTsEZb0Ak0qxxD3_mC5xd4QzatFpMSQdT=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n<img data-ref=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWk81HTJzmWT-PX4oXQTsEZb0Ak0qxxD3_mC5xd4QzatFpMSQdT=s120-c-rp-mo-br100\" alt=\"Christian donnelly\">\n</a><p>Christian Donnelly</p><p>09/18/2026 08:59 PM</p><p>5.0</p></li></ul>"
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
